## Rules

- Prefer tests that match the detected runner and project layout
- Do not add Playwright/Cypress/Jest solely because they are popular
- Do not claim a minimum coverage percentage unless the repository enforces one
{{#if IS_CLI}}
- For CLI tools, prioritize unit tests of parsers, scanners, resolvers, and validators
{{/if}}

## Prohibited

- Do NOT invent an E2E browser stack for a CLI without UI
- Do NOT treat TDD preference as an existing CI gate

